This extension adds S.T.A.L.K.E.R. 2: Heart of Chornobyl modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]GOG[/*]
[*]Epic[/*]
[*]Xbox (Game Pass)[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]

[size=3][b][color=#ea9999]This game does not support symlinks. You must have the mod staging folder and the game on the same drive to use this extension.[/color][/b][/size]

[size=3][b][color=#f9cb9c]UE4SS LogicMod (Blueprint) Mod Authors - You MUST include a "LogicMods" folder above your .pak file in order for this extension to install the mod to the correct location. Without this, there is no way to differentiate between LogicMod paks and regular pak mods.[/color][/b][/size]

[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs Simple Mod Merger mod with a file or folder named "simple_mod_merger.exe" to the "Stalker2SimpleModMerger" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs UE4SS Script-LogicMod Combo mod with both a "Content" and a "Binaries" folder to the "Stalker2" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs UE4SS LogicMods (Blueprint) mod with a "LogicMods" folder to the "Stalker2\Content\Paks" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs Herbata Mod (GameLite) mod with a file or folder named "GameLite" to the "Stalker2\Content" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs UE4SS mod with a "dwmapi.dll" file.[/*]
[*]Installs UE4SS Scripts mod with a ".lua" file and a "Scripts" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs UE4SS DLL mod with a ".dll" file and a "dlls" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs Root Game Folder mod with a top-level folder such as "Stalker2", "Engine" or "Content" to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[*]Installs Config (LocalAppData) mod with a config file such as "engine.ini" or "game.ini".[/*]
[*]Installs Saves (LocalAppData) mod with a ".sav" file.[/*]
[*]Installs Binaries (Engine Injector) mod with anything unrecognised with no pak file.[/*]
[*]Archives with a FOMOD installer (a "fomod" folder with ModuleConfig.xml) are handed to Vortex's built-in FOMOD installer instead.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

